{"id":"d0a20d5f74408674","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-levy-process.md","title":"Levy Process","display":"df-levy-process — Levy Process","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-levy-process","aliases":["58-df-levy-process","Levy Process"],"display":"df-levy-process — Levy Process","depends_on":["[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-stochastic-process.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-stationary-increments.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-cadlag.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-levy-process"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-levy-process</span><span>Levy Process</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-levy-process — Levy Process"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b5f77bed7dfe3f07\" href=\"?note=b5f77bed7dfe3f07\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-stochastic-process.md\">../batch05/58-df-stochastic-process.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"978522e3e7ee8e5c\" href=\"?note=978522e3e7ee8e5c\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-stationary-increments.md\">../batch18/58-df-stationary-increments.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"84ce8c835a688c6a\" href=\"?note=84ce8c835a688c6a\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-cadlag.md\">../batch20/58-df-cadlag.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,d\\in V\">\\(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,d\\in V\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_t=X(t)\">\\(X_t=X(t)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^d)\">\\(\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^d)\\)</span> 为欧氏 Borel σ-代数，向量差逐坐标定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StochProc}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{StochProc}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StationaryIncrements}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{StationaryIncrements}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cadlag}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cadlag}_S\\)</span> 取依赖文件中的完整参数定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IndependentIncrements}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,d)\">\\(\\mathrm{IndependentIncrements}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,d)\\)</span> 为下式定义的有限维独立增量谓词。</li>\n<li>单参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IndependentIncrements}_S(X)\">\\(\\mathrm{IndependentIncrements}_S(X)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StationaryIncrements}_S(X)\">\\(\\mathrm{StationaryIncrements}_S(X)\\)</span> 为下式的兼容投影；不替代带概率空间的主定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IndependentIncrements}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,d)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nd\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{StochProc}_S(X,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathbb R^d,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^d))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall t\\in(\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})^{n+1}\\;\n\\Bigl((\\forall i&lt;n\\;t(i)&lt;t(i+1))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\forall A\\in\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^d)^n\\;\n\\mathbb P\\!\\left(\\bigcap_{i&lt;n}\\{\\xi\\in\\Omega:X_{t(i+1)}(\\xi)-X_{t(i)}(\\xi)\\in A(i)\\}\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad=\\prod_{i&lt;n}\\mathbb P\\bigl(\\{\\xi\\in\\Omega:X_{t(i+1)}(\\xi)-X_{t(i)}(\\xi)\\in A(i)\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IndependentIncrements}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,d)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nd\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{StochProc}_S(X,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathbb R^d,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^d))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall t\\in(\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})^{n+1}\\;\n\\Bigl((\\forall i&lt;n\\;t(i)&lt;t(i+1))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\forall A\\in\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^d)^n\\;\n\\mathbb P\\!\\left(\\bigcap_{i&lt;n}\\{\\xi\\in\\Omega:X_{t(i+1)}(\\xi)-X_{t(i)}(\\xi)\\in A(i)\\}\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad=\\prod_{i&lt;n}\\mathbb P\\bigl(\\{\\xi\\in\\Omega:X_{t(i+1)}(\\xi)-X_{t(i)}(\\xi)\\in A(i)\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IndependentIncrements}_S(X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P\\in V\\;\\exists d\\in\\omega\\;\n\\mathrm{IndependentIncrements}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,d).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IndependentIncrements}_S(X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P\\in V\\;\\exists d\\in\\omega\\;\n\\mathrm{IndependentIncrements}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,d).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{StationaryIncrements}_S(X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P\\in V\\;\\exists d\\in\\omega\\;\n\\mathrm{StationaryIncrements}_S\\bigl(X,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\n\\mathbb R^d,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^d),\\{\\langle\\langle u,v\\rangle,u-v\\rangle:u,v\\in\\mathbb R^d\\}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{StationaryIncrements}_S(X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P\\in V\\;\\exists d\\in\\omega\\;\n\\mathrm{StationaryIncrements}_S\\bigl(X,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\n\\mathbb R^d,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^d),\\{\\langle\\langle u,v\\rangle,u-v\\rangle:u,v\\in\\mathbb R^d\\}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,d)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nd\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{IndependentIncrements}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,d)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathbb P(\\{\\xi\\in\\Omega:X_0(\\xi)=\\{\\langle j,0\\rangle:j&lt;d\\}\\})=1\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{StationaryIncrements}_S\\bigl(X,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\n\\mathbb R^d,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^d),\\{\\langle\\langle u,v\\rangle,u-v\\rangle:u,v\\in\\mathbb R^d\\}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\xi\\in\\Omega\\;\\mathrm{Cadlag}_S(\\{\\langle t,X_t(\\xi)\\rangle:t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\},d).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,d)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nd\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{IndependentIncrements}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,d)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathbb P(\\{\\xi\\in\\Omega:X_0(\\xi)=\\{\\langle j,0\\rangle:j&lt;d\\}\\})=1\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{StationaryIncrements}_S\\bigl(X,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\n\\mathbb R^d,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^d),\\{\\langle\\langle u,v\\rangle,u-v\\rangle:u,v\\in\\mathbb R^d\\}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\xi\\in\\Omega\\;\\mathrm{Cadlag}_S(\\{\\langle t,X_t(\\xi)\\rangle:t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\},d).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Levy process: càdlàg process with stationary independent increments</li>\n<li>The characteristic exponent and Levy-Khintchine formula are representation data for Levy processes, not the defining clause here.</li>\n<li>Brownian motion: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma^2 &gt; 0, \\Pi = 0\">\\(\\sigma^2 &gt; 0, \\Pi = 0\\)</span></li>\n<li>Poisson process: pure jump, no continuous part</li>\n<li>Stable: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi(u) = c|u|^\\alpha e^{i\\beta\\pi\\mathrm{sgn}(u)/2}\">\\(\\psi(u) = c|u|^\\alpha e^{i\\beta\\pi\\mathrm{sgn}(u)/2}\\)</span></li>\n<li>Infinitely divisible: characteristic exponent generates Levy process</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Kyprianou, Introductory Lectures on Fluctuations of Levy Processes</li>\n<li>Sato, Levy Processes and Infinitely Divisible Distributions</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-stochastic-process.md","status":"resolved","id":"b5f77bed7dfe3f07","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-stochastic-process.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-stationary-increments.md","status":"resolved","id":"978522e3e7ee8e5c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-stationary-increments.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-cadlag.md","status":"resolved","id":"84ce8c835a688c6a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location"