play":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,d)\\leftrightarrow{}&\nd\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{IndependentIncrements}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,d)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathbb P(\\{\\xi\\in\\Omega:X_0(\\xi)=\\{\\langle j,0\\rangle:j<d\\}\\})=1\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{StationaryIncrements}_S\\bigl(X,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\n\\mathbb R^d,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^d),\\{\\langle\\langle u,v\\rangle,u-v\\rangle:u,v\\in\\mathbb R^d\\}\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\xi\\in\\Omega\\;\\mathrm{Cadlag}_S(\\{\\langle t,X_t(\\xi)\\rangle:t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\},d).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma^2 > 0, \\Pi = 0","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi(u) = c|u|^\\alpha e^{i\\beta\\pi\\mathrm{sgn}(u)/2}","display":false}],"bytes":3309,"backlinks":[{"id":"5046df408bc6b564","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S\\subseteq V^5$ 与 $\\mathrm{IndependentIncrements}_S\\subseteq V$（后者是上游定义中对所有有限递增时刻族的互独立增量谓词，see [[../batch13/58-df-levy-process.md]]）"},{"id":"bec60cf74d373d75","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b44df7aeba18e12f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S\\subseteq V^5$ (Lévy-process predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-levy-process.md]])"},{"id":"50ccecf2bfaccddf","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"cbddf9eabf158853","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S\\subseteq V^5$ is the predicate from [[58-df-levy-process]]"},{"id":"e002586cbe5331e7","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S$ (Lévy-process predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-levy-process.md]])"},{"id":"e51f537bfbd5e417","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$d\\in\\omega_{>